      ],
      "title": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Seth argues that psychological biases make conscious AI seem plausible even though deep differences between brains and computers make real machine consciousness unlikely, so the urgent task is managing the ethics of both actual and merely seeming conscious AI.",
      "sourceHeading": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI"
    },
