      "title": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Deep-seated psychological biases—anthropocentrism, exceptionalism, anthropomorphism, and the lure of techno-rapture—make us prone to see consciousness in AI that merely seems intelligent.",
      "sourceHeading": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI"
    },
