        "spya-e7fdmb",
        "spya-d89xf7"
      ],
      "title": "What (Not) To Do?",
      "gist": "Given deep uncertainty about machine consciousness, Seth argues we should avoid deliberately creating conscious AI while also taking seriously the distinct ethical dangers posed by AI that merely seems conscious.",
      "sourceHeading": "What (Not) To Do?"
    },
    "n0136": {
      "id": "n0136",
      "depth": 2,
