        "spya-e7fdmb",
        "spya-zajp75"
      ],
      "title": "Why Fact Matters",
      "gist": "Because conscious things carry moral status, getting the facts right about AI consciousness matters, even though Seth's own case against it remains a minority, uncertain view."
    },
